        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Transition elements ki electronic configurations aam taur par Aufbau principle par chalti hain, do mustasna ke saath: chromium aur copper. Chromium [Ar] 3d5 4s1 aur copper [Ar] 3d10 4s1 hai, kyunke aadha bhara (3d5) ya poora bhara (3d10) d subshell khaas taur par mustahkam hai; is se electron badal zyada mutanasib (symmetrical) hota hai."
          },
